     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">I am currently making a test application with shiny server pro, for the purpose of trying google authentication.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">The steps I follow are described on: <a href=\"https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/219499547-Shiny-Server-Pro-Google-Authentication-Examples\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" style=\"color:rgb(0,89,153)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/219499547-Shiny-Server-Pro-Google-Authentication-Examples&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390230404000&amp;usg=AOvVaw14BGKVyiwDHx3IW2YYBiNM\">https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/219499547-Shiny-Server-Pro-Google-Authentication-Examples</a></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">So I have created a google application and configured shiny-server.conf.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">When I access my app in my web browser, the google authentication screen does show up. It allows me to enter my google credentials, but then it keeps on loading (so I am not redirected to my app). More specifically, the google authentication is successful, but the callback keeps on pending.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">The following is my shiny-server.conf file:</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(36,39,41)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\">run_as shiny;\r\nauth_google &lt;client id&gt; &lt;client secret&gt;;\r\nserver {\r\n  listen 80;\r\n  server_name test.&lt;website&gt;.com;\r\n  location {\r\n    site_dir /srv/testApp;\r\n    log_dir /var/log/testApp;\r\n    required_user *;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">What also might be useful to know is that the web location where the app is accessible (a subdomain of my own website), is redirected to my linux server (which has shiny server pro installed). This is specified in my cloudflare account.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Furthermore, I have tried to disable the firewall of my server, which also didn&#39;t help.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Thanks in advance.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Kind regards, </p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Jelle</p></div></div>"
